# STTM standalone — copy to .env (optional for local dev)
#
# LLM API keys (Gemini, Groq, OpenAI) are configured in the app:
# Settings → LLM Provider & API Key
#
# Local dev works out of the box with ./start.sh — no .env required.
# Uncomment only when deploying or customizing defaults.

# Optional: CORS allow-list for a deployed frontend (comma-separated)
# DATAMAP_CORS_ORIGINS=https://your-frontend.example.com

# Optional: production frontend build — API base URL (leave unset for local Vite proxy)
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api.example.com
